    "summary": "A long, rectangular cloth, for a domestic interior.  Very brightly patterned bands (twill woven), alternating with solid orange/red ones.  Both coloured and solid bands have large diamond patterning.  The coloured bands are repeated in sequence along the cloth, using tones of green, blue, pink, yellow, orange and purple wool yarns (with synthetic) and white cotton yarn.  Warp ends turned and hand stitched.  Unused.",
